-------------+----------+---------+----------------+--------------------+-----------------------+-------------------+----------------+----------+-------------------+----------------+---------------+----------------+---------------+--------------+------------
           0 |        1 |       1 |              1 |                  1 |                     1 | digits            | 0111           | Teeny    |                 1 | f              | Live/5        | Staff          |             0 | true/3       |          3
(1 row)

ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT s_units;
