-------------+----------+---------+----------------+--------------------+-----------------------+----------------------+----------------+----------+-------------------+----------------+---------------+----------------+---------------+--------------+------------
           0 |        0 |       0 |              0 |                  0 |                     0 | dot_after_two_digits | 01.11          | Teeny    |                 1 | f              | Live/5        | Staff          |             0 | true/3       |          3
